    "audience": "staff",
    "body": "One login can work for more than one organization: an assigner who runs officials for Sunshine Events Group and for his own events, say. You sign in once and switch between them.\n\n**To switch:** click your organization's logo at the top left (it has an arrow when you have more than one) and pick the other one under **Your organizations**. On a phone, tap the menu button: **Your organizations** is at the top. The app reloads in that organization.\n\n**What changes when you switch:**\n- Your role is the one that organization gave you. You can be a director in one and an assigner in the other.\n- You see that organization's events, Staff Pool, team and pages, and only those. Nothing from one organization shows in the other.\n- Each organization's plan decides which pages it has, so the menus can differ.\n\n**Links into the other organization's events** (an email about a game at one of their events, say) switch you there on the way in, then open the page.\n\n**Common problems:**\n- No arrow on your logo? You work for one organization. Whoever runs the other one adds you on their **Your team** page, with the email you sign in with.\n- An event you expected isn't listed? Check which organization you're in: the logo at the top left shows it.\n- A page says you can't open it? Your role or that organization's plan doesn't include it. Ask its director, or an admin."
