    "audience": "staff",
    "body": "Every staff member has a staff ID badge with their photo and role. Print it for a lanyard or add it to Apple Wallet on your phone.\n\n**Where:** on your home page, tap **My staff ID** under **My events**.\n\n**To print it:**\n1. Tap **Print my ID**.\n2. It prints at true badge size (2.125 by 3.375 inches). Cut along the card edge and punch the marked hole for a lanyard.\n\n**To add it to your phone:** tap **Add to Apple Wallet**. This button only appears when your organization has Wallet passes turned on.\n\nTap **My portal** to go back to your home page.\n\n**Common problems:**\n- **Your login isn't linked to a staff record yet.** Contact your coordinator.\n\n**Watch:** [Your staff ID](/dashboard/staff/training?v=staff-id) (about a minute each, in **Training videos** on your home page)."
