    "audience": "staff",
    "body": "The staff directory lists everyone on this tournament's staff roster, grouped by job, with buttons to call or text them.\n\n**Where:** **Live → Communications**, **Contacts** tab, or **Staff contacts** on your home page.\n\n**To find someone:**\n1. Type in **Search staff…**, or scroll the groups: **Field Ops**, **Athletic Trainers**, **Scorekeepers**, **Assigners**, **Referees**, **Directors** and **Staff**.\n2. Tap the phone button to call or the message button to text.\n\n**Common problems:**\n- **no #** means there is no phone number on file. An organizer can add it in the Staff Pool.\n- Only people on the tournament's **Staff roster** appear here.\n\n**Watch:** [Find and call any staff member](/dashboard/staff/training?v=directory) (about a minute each, in **Training videos** on your home page)."
