    "audience": "public",
    "body": "The event's hotel page lists the hotels holding a room block for the event, with the event rate and a button to book each one.\n\n**Where:** **Book hotels** on the event page, or the hotel link in your club's emails.\n\n1. Each hotel shows its **Event rate** per night. Tap **See rates & book** (or **Book**) to see the rates and book through the event's housing partner.\n2. A hotel marked **Sold out** has no rooms left in its block. Pick another one.\n3. To narrow the list, use **Sort** (**Recommended**, **Closest** or **Lowest price**) and the chain, distance and price filters. **View map** shows where they are; **Clear filters** starts over.\n4. **Good to know** has the event's notes about hotels and travel.\n5. Need something else? **See more hotels near the fields** opens a wider search.\n\n**Common problems:**\n- The event rate lasts only while the room block does. Book early.\n- No **See rates & book** on a hotel: its block is sold out, or it has no booking link yet. Pick another, or try **See more hotels near the fields**."
